msgid "SM Engineering"
msgstr "SM Engineering"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"
msgstr "https://github.com/fdebbi/steel-marketplace"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid ""
"Partner engineers and engineering missions. Engineers apply on their own "
"page and are approved by the platform; every study or inspection request "
"goes to the platform, which sends a quote to the client and gives the "
"mission to an approved engineer as a subcontractor. Clients never deal with "
"engineers directly. Requires SM Core."
msgstr ""
"المهندسون الشركاء والمهام الهندسية. يترشح المهندسون من صفحتهم الخاصة "
"وتعتمدهم المنصة؛ كل طلب دراسة أو معاينة يذهب إلى المنصة التي ترسل عرض سعر "
"للزبون وتسند المهمة إلى مهندس معتمد كمناول. لا يتعامل الزبائن مباشرة مع "
"المهندسين. يتطلب SM Core."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sm-engineering.php
msgid "ReuSteel"
msgstr "ReuSteel"

#: sm-engineering.php:47
msgid "SM Engineering needs the SM Core plugin. Activate it first."
msgstr "تحتاج SM Engineering إلى إضافة SM Core. فعّلها أولا."

